{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/th-uKGtcx0PuMM37I_yx5A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:29.878437+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/th-uKGtcx0PuMM37I_yx5A","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/cicfibqm7jGf3VK4znIFSyvajRnk1NauicRRQyPsuGnIjNNmYlg1L5iboI1ItvjricicUBRuFPgo5I7tCsoPxLOR18zzrEL1DQ5nevP71FIWOD02Y/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cicfibqm7jGf09XPib1vr6Izls9oWhnUmymt1mc5ufJngiciaSkFaAgAoDzRN1zRVIibjHZxB9OwEkezfpatGQvBAzHTgFia606DiaS0MicMqmpksJRI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为增进大学生对经济学学科的进一步了解，培养对经济学研究的浓厚兴趣，搭建高校大学生之间的交流平台，特举办“兰州大学经济学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动。现就有关事项通知如下。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>一、活动时间</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>2026年7月14-16日</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>二、活动名额</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>40人左右</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、学科方向</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>应用经济学、金融、税务</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>四、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（一）具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>（二）具备扎实的经济学理论功底，本科专业为经济学类或管理学类；或本科所学学科为数学、数据科学、人文地理学与城乡规划等相关学科。</span></p><p><span>（三）在校前5学期学业成绩排名占所在专业或班级前20%，且所有专业课成绩均须及格。</span></p><p><span>（四）英语水平良好，至少达到大学英语六级水平或相当能力。</span></p><p><span>（五）无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>五、申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong><span>（一）电子材料提交</span></strong></p><section><p><span><span>1.2026年兰州大学经济学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表（见附表1）；</span></span></p><p><span>2.两封专家亲笔签名推荐信（见附表2）；</span></p><p><span>3.本科前5个学期成绩单（由教务部门盖章），排名专业或班级前20％的证明（由教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></p><p><span>4.身份证、学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>5.英语六级证书或其他英语水平证明材料；</span></p><p><span>6.其它证明材料（如获奖证书、学术论文、TOEFL/IELTS/GRE/GMAT成绩单等复印件，非必须）；</span></p><p><span>请将上述申请材料扫描件按顺序排列整理为一个PDF文件于2026年7月5日18:00前发送至邮箱jjyjsjyjx@lzu.edu.cn，并通过问卷星完成报名登记，链接如下：https://v.wjx.cn/vm/hJgnLz4.aspx#</span></p><p><span>邮件主题及附件命名格式为：夏令营申请—XX大学（本科就读院校）—XX专业（本科就读专业）—姓名—申请学科【应用经济学/金融/税务】。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>（二）纸质材料提交</span></strong></p><section><p><span><span>申请人通过营员资格审核后，入营报到时提交夏令营报名表、成绩单原件和其他要求的纸质材料。</span></span></p><p><span>注：电子材料、纸质材料、问卷星报名登记提交缺一不可。材料须真实有效，因信息填写错误、填报虚假信息造成的后果由申请人本人承担。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>六、选拔考核</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院将组织专家逐一审核评估申请者提供的各项材料，择优确定夏令营参营名单，审核通过的夏令营参营名单将在经济学院官方网站上公布。未通过资格审核的申请人皆为未入选者，将不再另行通知。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>七、活动总体内容</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）开营典礼</span></p><p><span>   包括学院介绍、研究生培养及特色介绍</span></p></section><section><p><span>（二）讲座与交流</span></p><p><span>   1.名师课堂</span></p><p><span>   2.面谈会：与研究生导师面对面交流</span></p></section><section><p><span>（三）实践与考察</span></p><p><span>   参观走访：校史馆、榆中校区等</span></p></section><section><p><span>（四）营员考核：</span></p><p><span>   对营员进行综合考核，确定优秀营员名单。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>八、注意事项</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（一）参加夏令营的学员须严格遵守经济学院相关管理规定，严格按照日程安排进行学习和活动。</span></p></section><section><p><span>（二）为营员提供夏令营期间的住宿（双人标间，原则上双人入住，本地学校营员不提供住宿）、人身保险费。</span></p></section><section><p><span><span>（三）外地营员交通费报销说明：</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>1．实报实销，仅报销来兰交通费用，报销上限400元，限乘高铁二等座火车硬卧、汽车、飞机经济舱，须有原始票据，请自行安排往返交通，主办方不提供订票服务。</span></span></p><p><span>2.报到时请提供来程交通费报销凭证。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>九、联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>（一）咨询电话</span></strong></p><p><span>  0931-8912467/0931-5292402</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>（二）咨询时间</span></strong></p><p><span> 工作日上午8:30-12:00,下午14:30-18:00</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>兰州大学经济学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月24日</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/th-uKGtcx0PuMM37I_yx5A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：2026年兰州大学经济学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表.doc</a></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/th-uKGtcx0PuMM37I_yx5A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：兰州大学经济学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营专家推荐信.doc</a></span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>END</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>执行编辑 | 林士想</span></p><p><span>责任编辑 | 赵永泽 彭诗语</span></p><p><span>校审 | 肖敏</span></p><p><span>主编 | 唐佳欣</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cicfibqm7jGf0cD7ta2Zrcx00fuicXiaZjkr35hT3ibmqdJ402yJhDNFibpe2V2sO5FtIGI9picFR8jZzdjpl9J6NXSIqGzxichvkHszXoYibod0KFgI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"31fbd432e37694ada79eae8e3c48d442360c3a5727ea4e03fbaf11639f0d4c9e","textLength":1461